  "interpretation": "<ol data-start=\"1700\" data-end=\"2409\">\n<li data-start=\"1700\" data-end=\"1896\">\n<p data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1741\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1739\">No Pathogenic Variants Detected:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1745\" data-end=\"1896\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1745\" data-end=\"1808\">\n<p data-start=\"1747\" data-end=\"1808\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">No DNA mutations found in the targeted leukemia gene panel.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1896\">\n<p data-start=\"1814\" data-end=\"1896\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Correlate with clinical, morphological, cytogenetic, and other molecular findings.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"2189\">\n<p data-start=\"1901\" data-end=\"1954\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"1901\" data-end=\"1952\">Pathogenic/Likely Pathogenic Variants Detected:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1958\" data-end=\"2189\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1958\" data-end=\"2061\">\n<p data-start=\"1960\" data-end=\"2061\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Indicates the presence of <strong data-start=\"1986\" data-end=\"2006\">driver mutations</strong> associated with leukemia (e.g., AML, ALL, MDS, CML).</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2189\">\n<p data-start=\"2067\" data-end=\"2189\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Used for <strong data-start=\"2076\" data-end=\"2148\">diagnosis, prognosis, risk stratification, and therapeutic decisions</strong> (e.g., FLT3 inhibitors, IDH inhibitors).</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2191\" data-end=\"2409\">\n<p data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2215\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2213\">Clinical Notes:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2219\" data-end=\"2409\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2219\" data-end=\"2318\">\n<p data-start=\"2221\" data-end=\"2318\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">VAF trends over time may help assess <strong data-start=\"2258\" data-end=\"2292\">minimal residual disease (MRD)</strong> and treatment response.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2322\" data-end=\"2409\">\n<p data-start=\"2324\" data-end=\"2409\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Further testing (RNA fusion panels, cytogenetics, flow cytometry) may be recommended.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>",
